cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RetroAR: an archived study of online draft revision in autoregressive generation"
version: 0.1.0
license: "MIT"
type: software
abstract: >-
  An archived CPU-only study testing whether autoregressive generation benefits
  from revisable hard or soft drafts. Controlled graph-colouring experiments
  found effective iterative solving after complete evidence was available, but
  did not establish a distinctive advantage for generating and revising an
  early draft online.
message: "If you use this archive, please cite it."
authors:
  - name: holonova
keywords:
  - autoregressive generation
  - iterative refinement
  - graph colouring
  - negative result
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/HoloNova/retroar"
